            "title": "Trick Training: Be My Fur-Ever Valentine",
            "text": "<p><strong>● FEB 9 @ 8 PM EST ●</strong></p><p>Celebrate Valentine’s Day with your dog by teaching some cute, feel-good tricks that are just as fun to practice as they are to show off. We’ll work through simple, Valentine’s-themed tricks that build confidence, focus, and connection.</p>",
