            "title": "Workshop: Becoming Your Dog’s Favorite Person",
            "text": "<p><strong>● FEB 12 @ 8 PM EST ●</strong></p><p>Great training starts with connection, not just commands. In this workshop, you’ll learn how to build stronger communication with your dog so training feels easier and more natural in everyday life. We’ll cover simple mindset and interaction shifts that improve focus, trust, and responsiveness. </p>",
            "button_text": "RSVP",
            "calendly_widget": "",
            "button_link": "https://calendly.com/stephanie-laylopets/building-connections-workshop",
            "button_style": "btn--primary btn--small",
