            "title": "Pup Olympics: At-Home Edition",
            "text": "<p><strong>● FEB 22 @ 7 PM EST ●</strong></p><p>This at-home agility class is designed to turn everyday space into a confidence course. We’ll teach simple agility foundations using items you already have at home (think cones, chairs, broomsticks). It’s fun, energizing, and perfect for building focus, body awareness, and a dog who loves working with you.</p>",
