            "text": "<p><strong>● FEB 23 @ 7 PM EST ●</strong></p><p>Dog food labels are confusing on purpose. In this Homeschool Social Club class, we’ll break down how to read ingredient lists, spot marketing traps, and make smarter food + supplement choices for long-term health. You’ll leave feeling way more confident about what’s actually in your dog’s bowl.</p>",
